  "description": "In this report, we analyze the compromise of Cohort, starting with the discovery of an SSRF vulnerability on the main web application that bypassed loopback validation to enumerate internal endpoints. This led to the identification of an internal Marimo notebook service running on a subdomain. Exploiting a pre-authentication terminal WebSocket RCE (CVE-2026-39987) in Marimo allowed us to gain initial access as the marimo user. Finally, local privilege escalation was achieved by exploiting a TOCTOU race condition in PackageKit (CVE-2026-41651) to obtain root access.",
